n använda form bör tagas ss normalform (jfr f.ö.dess s.8). Namnen på s.18 & 77 har av utg. konstruerade former, eg.= klamrade; eden s.77 = formulär m. tomrum för namnet. I protokoll etc oftast Malheim. Faderns namn: Maellem. Gift Ekström. - 960110/REG  a{"@id":"pm134gq73hdwjkv","modified":"2018-03-26T12:44:25+02:00","checksum":"21418321937"}2librisxl00716cz  a  00193n  450000100070000000500170000700800410002402400200006502400270008504000140011204300120012608300200013810000290015866700760018767000490026367000540031267800520036688701040041834881620180326131220.0111125nb ac|nnaabn          |n aaa    ||7 a1085753682viaf7 a000000012147035X2isni  aSbsweec  ae-uk---04a823.914223/swe1 aForeman, Michael,d1938-  aUppdaterad med deweykod 2017-07-03 S/NB/annbjo. 2011-11-25. S/NB/evaabr  aKensukes rike, 2011:bt.p. (Michael Foreman)  aLC i VIAF (2011-11-25)b(Foreman, Michael, 1938-)  aBrittisk barnboksförfattare och illustratör  a{"@id":"nl0383r64kv51v0","modified":"2018-03-26T13:12:20+02:00","checksum":"57687055645"}2librisxl00901cz  a  00229n  450000100070000000500170000700800410002402400270006503500230009204000140011504300120012910000360014140000450017740000470022240000500026940000550031940000550037440000360042967000070046567800950047288701040056718842120121001103016.0021218n| ac|nnaabn          |n aaa    |c7 a00000001210141002isni  a(LIBRIS)9917326642  aLbsweec  ae-fr---1 aGoncourt, Edmond de,d1822-18961 aGoncourt, Edmond L. A. H. De,d1822-18961 aGoncourt, Edmond Louis Antoine,d1822-18961 aGoncourt, Edmond Louis Antoine de,d1822-18961 aGoncourt, Edmond Louis Antoine Huot de,d1822-18961 aGoncourt, Edmond Louis Antoine Hyot de,d1822-18961 aGonkur, Ėdmond de,d1822-1896  aNE  aSkönlitterär författare, konst och kulturhistoriker. Skrev tills. med sin bror Jules  a{"@id":"53hkkn1p5lbs5t4","modified":"2012-10-01T10:30:16+02:00","checksum":"52133613281"}2librisxl00699cz  a  00193n  45000