rades för att framföras för en intimare publik vid tidens litterära och konstnärliga salonger, medan den något senare underhållningsmusiken riktade sig mot en bredare och mer allmän publik via exempelvis restauranger, offentliga konserter, radio och grammofon. På engelska betecknas musik i genren ofta som "light classics" eller bara "light music".  a{"@id":"86lpw47s3nb7x0r","modified":"2016-11-01T12:49:08+01:00","checksum":"11612024621"}2librisxl00541cz  a  00169n  450000100070000000500170000700800410002402400190006502400270008403500230011104000140013404300120014810000460016040000460020667800150025288701040026718892420180326134015.0021218n| ac|nnaabn          |n aaa    |c7 a171927292viaf7 a00000000524978492isni  a(LIBRIS)9917331719  aLbsweec  ae-sw---1 aGünther-Rådström, Catharina,d1951-1 aRådström, Catharina Günther,d1951-  aKonstnär  a{"@id":"xv8bbfcg367h1rd","modified":"2018-03-26T13:40:15+02:00","checksum":"66106468613"}2librisxl00747cz  a  00265n  450000100070000000500170000700800410002403500150006504000170008004200090009706500150010615000190012155000120014055000260015255000250017855000330020355000240023655000290026055000150028955000290030455000150033375000090034875000190035788701050037614724520140512113533.0020409n| az|nnbabn          |n ana    ||  a(sao)14347  aNBbswefsao  9Fack  aCh2kssb/7  aGudstjänsten  wgaKult  whaBarngudstjänster  whaTv-gudstjänster  whaDramatik i gudstjänsten  whaAndakter i radio  whaFinska gudstjänster  whaJulotta  whaFamiljegudstjänster  whaKollekt 0aMass 0aPublic worship  a{"@id":"mkz10lr51ccrbq8","modified":"2014-05-12T11:35:33+02:00","checksum":"216491412437"}2librisxl00468cz  a  00157n  450000100070000000500170000700800410002402400270006504000160009204300070010810000280011540000280014367000070017167800280017888701040020625813220050726090846.0050726n| aa|nnaabn          |n aaa    |d7 a00000004348336922isni  aSRobswe