 ombildades föreningen från en yrkessammanslutning till en facklig organisation. 1943 beslutades om en omorganisation så att de tidigare filialföreningarna gjordes om till distrikt och att klubbar bildades vid de större kontoren. Samtidigt ändrades föreningens namn till Svenska Bankmannaförbundet. 1994 ändrades namnet till Finansförbundet.  a{"@id":"dbqsqr0x4gtbwkr","modified":"2020-06-01T10:44:49.911+02:00","checksum":"24370639713"}2librisxl00485cz  a  00157n  450000100070000000500170000700800410002403500150006504000170008004200090009706500170010615000320012355000260015575000420018188701040022316843020140512123114.0020409n| az|nnbabn          |n ana    ||  a(sao)54517  aNBbswefsao  9Fack  aGocm2kssb/7  aMedeltidslatinsk litteratur  wgaLatinsk litteratur 0aLatin literature, Medieval and modern  a{"@id":"sq466kgb0s45nj8","modified":"2014-05-12T12:31:14+02:00","checksum":"94220028033"}2librisxl00878cz  a  00289n  450000100070000000500170000700800410002403500150006504000170008004200090009706500190010606500170012508300190014215000230016145000320018445000280021655000190024455000240026355000320028755000380031955000380035755000220039555000160041755000220043375000250045588701080048016399220200615141639.0020409n| az|nnbabn          |n ana    ||  a(sao)48800  aNBbswefsao  9Fack  aF:dofa2kssb/7  aF:do2kssb/704a401.93223/swe  aSpråkinlärning  aFörstaspråksinlärning  aModersmålsinlärning  wgaInlärning  wgaSpråkpsykologi  whaAndraspråksinlärning  whaInterferens (språkvetenskap)  whaFrämmandespråksinlärning  whaInterimspråk  aBarnspråk  aSpråkutveckling 0aLanguage acquisition  a{"@id":"vs688gld5cdpjz6","modified":"2020-06-15T14:16:39.333+02:00","checksum":"93096334404"}2librisxl00738cz  a  00253n  450000100070000000500170000700800410002403500150006504000170008004200150009706500160011206500150012806500430014308300350018608300350022115000120025645000170026855000250028555